{
  "publication_number": "CN113902039A",
  "title": "Black product user identification method, system, electronic device and storage medium",
  "assignee": "China United Network Communications Group Co Ltd",
  "filing_date": "2021-11-08",
  "publication_date": "2022-01-07",
  "pse": {
    "problem": "The prior art black product user identification method suffers from low accuracy and low identification efficiency due to limitations in local learning models, information collection methods, and insufficient privacy and data safety measures.",
    "solution_function": "The invention optimizes a local learning model through joint learning while ensuring user privacy and data safety, providing more accurate and rapid black product user identification for enterprise customers. It combines modeling on the trained identification model and encrypted user data sets uploaded by all operators to obtain a combined model.",
    "solution_structure": "The solution consists of local hardware (processing units) that acquires user fixed network data, trains local recognition models, and encrypts local user data. It also includes a federated learning platform as a central software component where the combined modeling takes place.",
    "solution_implementation": "The local hardware collects user data, processes it to create a local user dataset, trains local recognition models with black product labeled data from this dataset, and encrypts user attribute information. The encrypted local user data set and the trained identification model are then uploaded to the federated learning platform for combined modeling. The platform uses user data uploaded by all operators to train the combined model, which is returned with its coefficient to each operator.",
    "effect": "The solution results in more accurate and rapid black product user identification for enterprise customers, purifies network space for operators, reduces property loss."
  },
